# OPIc Sample Answer - Day16

Last year, I had to give an important presentation in front of several people.

I thought it would be extremely difficult because I wasn't confident about speaking in front of others.

However, it turned out that the presentation went better than I expected.

I prepared my presentation several times beforehand, so I became more comfortable as I practiced.

At first, I was really nervous, but after a few minutes, I started to relax.

In the end, I received positive feedback, and I realized that preparation can make a big difference.
